259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 237 0 R
/T (As we head into May, there is a real sense of excitement and momentum here in Vineyard. Warmer weather, longer days, and families returning outdoors remind us why so many people love calling Vineyard home. )
/E (As we head into May, there is a real sense of excitement and momentum here in Vineyard. Warmer weather, longer days, and families returning outdoors remind us why so many people love calling Vineyard home. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
260 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 237 0 R
/T (This month also means we are preparing for one of the most anticipated events of the year: Vineyard Days. Vineyard Days is more than just a celebration. It is an opportunity for neighbors, families, businesses, and friends to come together and celebrate the community. )
/E (This month also means we are preparing for one of the most anticipated events of the year: Vineyard Days. Vineyard Days is more than just a celebration. It is an opportunity for neighbors, families, businesses, and friends to come together and celebrate the community. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 237 0 R
/T (From the new motorized parade and carnival to the fireworks to activities at Grove Park, children's market, local vendors, car show, and family events, there will truly be something for everyone to enjoy. This year is especially meaningful as we welcome Olympian and Vineyard resident Caleb Furnell as our first-ever Grand Marshal.)
/E (From the new motorized parade and carnival to the fireworks to activities at Grove Park, children's market, local vendors, car show, and family events, there will truly be something for everyone to enjoy. This year is especially meaningful as we welcome Olympian and Vineyard resident Caleb Furnell as our first-ever Grand Marshal.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
262 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 237 0 R
/T (As your Mayor, one of my goals has been to continue building a city government that communicates openly, listens to residents, and creates opportunities for community connection. Events like Vineyard Days help strengthen those connections and remind us that despite different backgrounds or opinions, we are all neighbors working toward a brighter future for our city.)
/E (As your Mayor, one of my goals has been to continue building a city government that communicates openly, listens to residents, and creates opportunities for community connection. Events like Vineyard Days help strengthen those connections and remind us that despite different backgrounds or opinions, we are all neighbors working toward a brighter future for our city.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
